              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karla G"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great! I have a low-sugar tollerant child, so I didn't have the sweetened ingredients in my cubboard. I didn't add the sweetened milk, just added the extra fatfree milk. Instead of regular maple sugar, I added the sugar-free pancake syrup. It tasted great!!"
