            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I changed the proportions of things in this because 2 cups of protein powder would have made a sludge. I was guessing the recipe really meant 2 SCOOPS. I think this has way too much sweet stuff... I added half the maple syrup and it was sweet enough.. thinned it out with unsweetened almond milk instead of sweetened condensed. I did really love the flavor of the avocado in this.. never tried it in a smoothie before",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-25T16:41:29.850Z"
          },
